1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,778
AI made building software cheap.
Running it is another story.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:06,798
Type what you want, and you’ll
have an app by the afternoon.

3
00:00:06,975 --> 00:00:08,447
It looks great in the demo.

4
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:09,772
Then you have to run it.

5
00:00:09,892 --> 00:00:12,103
Something breaks, and nobody knows why.

6
00:00:12,123 --> 00:00:13,733
It slows down as you grow.

7
00:00:13,753 --> 00:00:15,359
And nobody’s sure it’s secure.

8
00:00:15,517 --> 00:00:16,951
The tool can write code.

9
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:18,742
It can’t tell you if it’s the right code.

10
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:21,323
An agency can, at agency prices.

11
00:00:21,558 --> 00:00:23,084
That’s where QUAICU comes in.

12
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:26,581
We use AI to work faster, so you pay less.

13
00:00:26,767 --> 00:00:32,274
And experienced engineers make the calls that matter:
how it’s built, how it’s secured, and how it grows.

14
00:00:32,808 --> 00:00:35,680
We started out building
AI governance technology.

15
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,745
That work earned us a place
in NASSCOM’s DeepTech cohort.

16
00:00:38,765 --> 00:00:43,710
We’re also part of NVIDIA Inception, and
supported by Google for Startups and T-Hub.

17
00:00:44,475 --> 00:00:50,096
It’s also why every change we make is reviewed
before it ships, and every decision is written down.

18
00:00:50,308 --> 00:00:56,064
Which means your software keeps running long after launch,
and nothing about it lives only in one person’s head.

19
00:00:56,142 --> 00:00:58,563
QUAICU. Software service
that doesn’t fade.

